  "prefLabel": "Liq 208.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 208.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the manner in which the commission will provide notice to municipalities prior to issuing or renewing licenses, the manner in which the commission will communicate denials of licenses to license applicants, and how the commission will hold hearings following such denials upon the request of an applicant.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Liq 200) #13992, eff 5-31-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
